WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:07.600
AI is powerful. But most of it is rented… by the word.

2
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.200
So Elah built me to live with you.

3
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.400
Hi, I'm Samantha.

4
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.600
Let me show you how this works.

5
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.300
Plans… built in seconds.

6
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Change your mind? Turn the dial.

7
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.400
Three ideas. I'll remember your favourite.

8
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:30.800
Need more hands? My crew works while you don't.

9
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.800
Bugs fixed. No meter running.

10
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.900
And everything stays private. By default.

11
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:43.000
Everything I know, you can see… and change.

12
00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:47.400
No usage limits. No meter. Just yours.

13
00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:53.200
I'm Samantha, from Elah. Intelligence you can hold.
